  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response to Humanitarian needs in Amhara Region through Cash and Shelter/Non Food items Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The crisis in Amhara region in Ethiopia has caused an increase in essential needs of the most vulnerable internally displaced persons (IDPs) and returnees residing in crisis-affected areas. This proposed intervention aims to improve their dignity and living conditions by addressing their urgent needs through multi-purpose cash assistance (MPCA) and shelter/non-food item (SNFI) assistance through the management of Shelter/NFI Cluster pipeline.</narrative>
  </description>
